6. Subsets — First major pattern

Given:  nums = [1,2,3]
    Each element gives us two choices:
    
            include
            exclude
    
    Therefore:
                    []
                  /    \
                [1]     []
               /  \     / \
           [1,2] [1]  [2]  []

The recursion tree has:  2 × 2 × 2 = 2³  leaves.
